{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/blood_pickup_gif.gif?t=1749004636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A town is being bled dry by a hidden cult, and every drop of blood fuels their dark magic. Tear through their ranks before they amass enough blood to usher in a new world order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of Dominic, a man with the unique power to eject blades from his wrists. After learning about missing people in his hometown, Dominic stumbles onto the underground plot that will change his life forever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/store_page_gif_updated_128.gif?t=1749004636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Them All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Dominic and his allies: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darius, a mage that picks up the blood of fallen foes and uses it to cast devastating magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demi, a woman who can shoot regenerating spines out of her forearms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use each character's unique skill set to slash, stab, punch, and shoot your way through the cult's compounds. Use stealth tactics to get the jump on your enemies, or confront them head on, odds be damned.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Violent, blood-pumping action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 playable characters with unique play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">57 levels of ramping  difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of mystery and intrigue</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-game challenges!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the S ratings by completing levels under a certain time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play every level as your favorite character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode: Can you beat the whole game without dying?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed running</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191550?t=1749004636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191550?t=1749004636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/4b585873dbe96f50b7cfe22dfe355fba0688105c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749004636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/4b585873dbe96f50b7cfe22dfe355fba0688105c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749004636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent intense acts of violence, blood and gore, profanity, references to tobacco, depictions of cuts on wrists"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3331150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/blood_pickup_gif.gif?t=1749004636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Mysterious Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A town is being bled dry by a hidden cult, and every drop of blood fuels their dark magic. Tear through their ranks before they amass enough blood to usher in a new world order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of Dominic, a man with the unique power to eject blades from his wrists. After learning about missing people in his hometown, Dominic stumbles onto the underground plot that will change his life forever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191550/extras/store_page_gif_updated_128.gif?t=1749004636\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Them All</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Dominic and his allies: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darius, a mage that picks up the blood of fallen foes and uses it to cast devastating magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demi, a woman who can shoot regenerating spines out of her forearms</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use each character's unique skill set to slash, stab, punch, and shoot your way through the cult's compounds. Use stealth tactics to get the jump on your enemies, or confront them head on, odds be damned.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Violent, blood-pumping action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 playable characters with unique play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">57 levels of ramping  difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of mystery and intrigue</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Post-game challenges!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the S ratings by completing levels under a certain time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play every level as your favorite character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore mode: Can you beat the whole game without dying?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed running</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alexander Urban"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/